Falsifies `filesystem_contract::proofs::a_resolved_request_never_widens`.

The defect: `Rights::resolve` answers every right for the sentinel instead of the parent's own.

Expected to fail: `assert!(parent.resolve(directory::PARENT_RIGHTS) == parent.bits())`, since the sentinel answers every right and not the parent's own. The first assertion cannot see this defect, because `attenuate` masks the answer.

diff --git a/crates/filesystem_contract/src/directory.rs b/crates/filesystem_contract/src/directory.rs
--- a/crates/filesystem_contract/src/directory.rs
+++ b/crates/filesystem_contract/src/directory.rs
@@ -208,7 +208,7 @@
     /// attenuate).
     pub const fn resolve(self, requested: u64) -> u64 {
         if requested == PARENT_RIGHTS {
-            self.0
+            u64::MAX
         } else {
             requested
         }
